        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-DVS100012HEXSBR, Solid Brass Hexagon Glass Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hexagon Glass Door Pull is very modern with a unique shape. This door handle can be thru-bolt mounted or back-to-back mounted on any glass door including store fronts and shower doors. It is available in a huge selection of finishes. The Hexagon Shower Door Pull is 12 inches long with 8 inch mounting centers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/hexagon-door-pull-first-impressions-dvs100hexsbr\"><b>Hexagon Door Pull</b></a> in other sizes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions SD-DVS100012HEXSBR Davis Hexagon Shower Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DVS01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262335\"><b>First Impressions DVS100012HEXSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 8 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 1 door pull, 2 inside screw covers, plus mounting hardware for mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
