                "title": "Hexagon Shower Door Pull",
                "description": "The Hexagon Glass Door Pull is very modern with a unique shape. This door handle can be thru-bolt mounted or back-to-back mounted on any glass door including store fronts and shower doors. It is available in a huge selection of finishes. The Hexagon Shower Door Pull is 12 inches long with 8 inch mounting centers.",
